==Strategy==
The Iron Balls start becoming a bit overwhelming here. There's two ways to go about handling them: either brute force their HP with lots of meatshields and fast attackers like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]], or bring a dedicated [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitter]]. Either way, there shouldn't be enough to actually stand in your way for too long if you play your cats right.

